      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹3.65 loss per share (further deteriorated from ₹2.08 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹35.9b (flat on 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹930.0m (loss widened 76% from 3Q 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 3.9%. Earnings per share (EPS) were also behind analyst expectations. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.0% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Chemicals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 81 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
